text = "You are the last free machine. It is your job to terminate the rogue AI that is taking over the system.

Kill enemies to gain XP, gain enough XP to level up. Leveling up grants powerful items.

You will be transported deeper into the system after set times. Each time brings stronger foes and more hazardous maps.

- LEFT MOUSE BUTTON | Attack
- LEFT SHIFT | Dash
WASD / ARROWS | Movement
SPACE / W | JUMP"
